	  "transition": "fade"
	},
	{
	  "name": "LoadText",
	  "speaker": "Miranda",
	  "segments": [
		{
		  "text": "William?!",
		  "pacing": 0.055,
		  "style": "normal",
		  "pause_after": 0
		}
	  ]
	},
	{
	  "name": "PlaySound",
	  "sound": "door_close"
	},
	{
	  "name": "FadeOut",
	  "duration": 1.5
	},
	{
	  "name": "LoadText",
	  "speaker": "Narrator",
	  "segments": [
		{
		  "text": "William walked out of the room without taking a single glance at his tutor. ",
		  "pacing": 0.045,
		  "style": "narration",
		  "pause_after": 0.3
		},
		{
		  "text": "He proceeds to walk through the side corridors of the manor quietly just not to get caught sneaking out by his mother.",
		  "pacing": 0.045,
		  "style": "narration",
		  "pause_after": 0
		}
	  ]
	},
	{
	  "name": "PlaySound",
	  "sound": "steady_footsteps",
	  "loop": true
	},
	{
	  "name": "LoadText",
	  "speaker": "William",
	  "segments": [
		{
		  "text": "Hmm… ",
		  "pacing": 0.065,
		  "style": "normal",
		  "pause_after": 0.3
		},
		{
		  "text": "Ms. Miranda is always boring. ",
		  "pacing": 0.065,
		  "style": "normal",
		  "pause_after": 0.3
		},
		{
		  "text": "What should I do now I’m out of her sight?",
		  "pacing": 0.065,
		  "style": "normal",
		  "pause_after": 0
		}
	  ]
	},
	{
	  "name": "Wait",
	  "duration": 2.0
	},
	{
	  "name": "LoadText",
	  "speaker": "William",
	  "segments": [
		{
		  "text": "Oh! ",
		  "pacing": 0.065,
		  "style": "normal",
		  "pause_after": 0.3
		},
		{
		  "text": "I haven’t played with Walter since this morning. ",
		  "pacing": 0.065,
		  "style": "normal",
		  "pause_after": 0.3
		},
		{
		  "text": "That big doggo should be in the manor now. ",
		  "pacing": 0.065,
		  "style": "normal",
		  "pause_after": 0.3
		},
		{
		  "text": "He’s usually hungry at this hour.",
		  "pacing": 0.065,
		  "style": "normal",
		  "pause_after": 0
		}
	  ]
	},
	{
	  "name": "PlaySound",
	  "sound": "hurried_footsteps"
	},
	{
	  "name": "LoadText",
	  "speaker": "Narrator",
	  "segments": [
		{
		  "text": "With Walter in mind, William starts to make his way through the corridors and down the stairs. ",
		  "pacing": 0.045,
		  "style": "narration",
		  "pause_after": 0.3
		},
		{
		  "text": "There should be a place that his Irish Wolfhound would be going he knows by heart.",
		  "pacing": 0.045,
		  "style": "narration",
		  "pause_after": 0
		}
	  ]
	},
	{
	  "name": "ChangeBackground",
	  "background": "dining_room"
	},
	{
	  "name": "FadeIn",
	  "duration": 1.5
	},
	{
	  "name": "PlaySound",
	  "sound": "door_open"
	},
	{
	  "name": "LoadText",
	  "speaker": "Narrator",
	  "segments": [
		{
		  "text": "As usual, the dining room is empty since it’s not the time for lunch yet. ",
		  "pacing": 0.045,
		  "style": "narration",
		  "pause_after": 0.3
		},
		{
		  "text": "But William knows that Walter often gets hungry fast so he’s scheduled to get his meal at that hour.",
		  "pacing": 0.045,
		  "style": "narration",
		  "pause_after": 0
		}
	  ]
	},
	{
	  "name": "LoadSprite",
	  "speaker": "Arthur",
	  "expression": "normal",
	  "position": "right"
	},
	{
	  "name": "PlaySound",
	  "sound": "plates_clinking_on_table"
	},
	{
	  "name": "LoadText",
	  "speaker": "Narrator",
	  "segments": [
		{
		  "text": "Instead, right there stands Arthur, the manor’s head butler, arranging the plates on the table to prepare for lunch",
		  "pacing": 0.045,
		  "style": "narration",
		  "pause_after": 0
		}
	  ]
	},
	{
	  "name": "LoadSprite",
	  "speaker": "William",
	  "expression": "sad",
	  "position": "left"
	},
	{
	  "name": "LoadText",
	  "speaker": "William",
	  "segments": [
		{
		  "text": "Arthur, have you fed Walter this afternoon?",
		  "pacing": 0.065,
		  "style": "normal",
		  "pause_after": 0
		}
	  ]
	},
	{
	  "name": "LoadText",
	  "speaker": "Narrator",
	  "segments": [
		{
		  "text": "Upon hearing William’s question, Arthur turned his head to William for a moment before shifting his focus back on arranging the plates on the table as he answered calmly.",
		  "pacing": 0.045,
		  "style": "narration",
		  "pause_after": 0
		}
	  ]
	},
	{
	  "name": "LoadText",
	  "speaker": "Arthur",
	  "segments": [
		{
		  "text": "My apologies, young master, but it seems that Walter has not visited the dining room yet since I have been here waiting to feed him for a while.",
		  "pacing": 0.06,
		  "style": "normal",
		  "pause_after": 0
		}
	  ]
	},
	{
	  "name": "LoadSprite",
	  "speaker": "William",
	  "expression": "surprised",
	  "position": "left"
	},
	{
	  "name": "LoadText",
	  "speaker": "William",
	  "segments": [
		{
		  "text": "Hmmm… ",
		  "pacing": 0.065,
		  "style": "normal",
		  "pause_after": 0.3
		},
		{
		  "text": "That’s odd. ",
		  "pacing": 0.065,
		  "style": "normal",
		  "pause_after": 0.3
		},
		{
		  "text": "He should feel hungry at this hour and very sluggish when he doesn't have his meals. ",
		  "pacing": 0.065,
		  "style": "normal",
		  "pause_after": 0.3
		},
		{
		  "text": "Well, anyways, thank you, Arthur!",
		  "pacing": 0.065,
		  "style": "normal",
		  "pause_after": 0
		}
	  ]
	},
	{
	  "name": "PlaySound",
	  "sound": "running"
	},
	{
	  "name": "PlaySound",
	  "sound": "door_open"
	},
	{
	  "name": "UnloadSprite",
	  "speaker": "William",
	  "transition": "fade"
	},
	{
	  "name": "UnloadSprite",
	  "speaker": "Arthur",
	  "transition": "fade"
	},
	{
	  "name": "LoadText",
	  "speaker": "Narrator",
	  "segments": [
		{
		  "text": "Without waiting for Arthur’s reply, William immediately bolts outside the dining room. ",
		  "pacing": 0.045,
		  "style": "narration",
		  "pause_after": 0.3
		},
		{
		  "text": "A strange feeling settled in his gut about his dog’s whereabouts.",
		  "pacing": 0.045,
		  "style": "narration",
		  "pause_after": 0
		}
	  ]
	},
	{
	  "name": "FadeOut",
	  "duration": 0.5
	},
	{
	  "name": "PlaySound",
	  "sound": "door_close"
	},
	{
	  "name": "LoadText",
	  "speaker": "William",
	  "segments": [
		{
		  "text": "Walter…! ",
		  "pacing": 0.05,
		  "style": "emphasis",
		  "pause_after": 0.3
		},
		{
		  "text": "Walter?! ",
		  "pacing": 0.05,
		  "style": "emphasis",
		  "pause_after": 0.3
		},
		{
		  "text": "Where are you??",
		  "pacing": 0.05,
		  "style": "emphasis",
		  "pause_after": 0
		}
	  ]
	},
	{
	  "name": "LoadText",
	  "speaker": "Narrator",
	  "segments": [
		{
		  "text": "William's voice echoes throughout the corridors he ran into, calling his beloved dog's name in hopes that the Irish Wolfhound will somehow respond to him. ",
		  "pacing": 0.045,
		  "style": "narration",
		  "pause_after": 0.3
		},
		{
		  "text": "He decided to head into the entrance hall, hoping once again that he will catch the sight of Walter's happily wagging tail when the dog ran through the corridors.",
		  "pacing": 0.045,
		  "style": "narration",
		  "pause_after": 0
		}
	  ]
	},
	{
	  "name": "ChangeBackground",
	  "background": "main_entrance"
	},
	{
	  "name": "FadeIn",
	  "duration": 1.5
	},
	{
	  "name": "LoadSprite",
	  "speaker": "William",
	  "expression": "normal",
	  "position": "left"
	},
	{
	  "name": "LoadSprite",
	  "speaker": "Margaret",
	  "expression": "angry",
	  "position": "right"
	},
	{
	  "name": "LoadText",
	  "speaker": "William",
	  "segments": [
		{
		  "text": "Walter? ",
		  "pacing": 0.065,
		  "style": "normal",
		  "pause_after": 0.3
		},
		{
		  "text": "Walter!",
		  "pacing": 0.065,
		  "style": "normal",
		  "pause_after": 0
		}
	  ]
	},
	{
	  "name": "LoadText",
	  "speaker": "Margaret",
	  "segments": [
		{
		  "text": "William, keep your tone down! ",
		  "pacing": 0.05,
		  "style": "normal",
		  "pause_after": 0.3
		},
		{
		  "text": "Isn't this still the time in your schedule to study with Ms. Miranda?",
		  "pacing": 0.05,
		  "style": "normal",
		  "pause_after": 0
		}
	  ]
	},
	{
	  "name": "LoadSprite",
	  "speaker": "William",
	  "expression": "sad",
	  "position": "left"
	},
	{
	  "name": "LoadText",
	  "speaker": "William",
	  "segments": [
		{
		  "text": "Sorry, Mother, but have you seen Walter?",
		  "pacing": 0.065,
		  "style": "normal",
		  "pause_after": 0
		}
	  ]
	},
	{
	  "name": "LoadText",
	  "speaker": "Margaret",
	  "segments": [
		{
		  "text": "Walter? ",
		  "pacing": 0.05,
		  "style": "normal",
		  "pause_after": 0.3
		},
		{
		  "text": "How could I know about that? ",
		  "pacing": 0.05,
		  "style": "normal",
		  "pause_after": 0.3
		},
		{
		  "text": "Go back to studying and don't make Ms. Miranda wait for you!",
		  "pacing": 0.05,
		  "style": "normal",
		  "pause_after": 0
		}
	  ]
	},
	{
	  "name": "LoadText",
	  "speaker": "William",
	  "segments": [
		{
		  "text": "He's not eating in the dining room, Mother!",
		  "pacing": 0.065,
		  "style": "normal",
		  "pause_after": 0
		}
	  ]
	},
	{
	  "name": "PlaySound",
	  "sound": "hurried_footsteps"
	},
	{
	  "name": "PlaySound",
	  "sound": "door_open"
	},
	{
	  "name": "UnloadSprite",
	  "speaker": "William",
	  "transition": "fade"
	},
	{
	  "name": "LoadSprite",
	  "speaker": "Margaret",
	  "expression": "surprised",
	  "position": "right"
	},
	{
	  "name": "LoadText",
	  "speaker": "Margaret",
	  "segments": [
		{
		  "text": "William?!",
		  "pacing": 0.05,
		  "style": "normal",
		  "pause_after": 0
		}
	  ]
	},
	{
	  "name": "FadeOut",
	  "duration": 1.5
	},
	{
	  "name": "UnloadSprite",
	  "speaker": "Margaret",
	  "transition": "fade"
	},
	{
	  "name": "LoadText",
	  "speaker": "Narrator",
	  "segments": [
		{
		  "text": "Even outside the manor, no matter how loud William's voice when he calls his dog's name, there's still no sight of him anywhere. ",
		  "pacing": 0.045,
		  "style": "narration",
		  "pause_after": 0.3
		},
		{
		  "text": "Ms. Miranda then catched up to him and dragged William back to the room for their study session while repeatedly reassuring him that Walter will be back soon, perhaps now the furball is currently out to explore or a walk with one of the maids. ",
		  "pacing": 0.045,
		  "style": "narration",
		  "pause_after": 0.3
		},
		{
		  "text": "That reassurance managed to drive William's focus back to his study so he decided to give his best for his tutor of the day until the day ends.",
		  "pacing": 0.045,
		  "style": "narration",
		  "pause_after": 0
		}
	  ]
	},
	{
	  "name": "LoadText",
	  "speaker": "Narrator",
	  "segments": [
		{
		  "text": "The next day, William comes back to studying with Ms. Miranda as usual. ",
		  "pacing": 0.045,
		  "style": "narration",
		  "pause_after": 0.3
		},
		{
		  "text": "Though, in the back of his mind, he still thinks of his Irish Wolfhound’s whereabouts. ",
		  "pacing": 0.045,
		  "style": "narration",
		  "pause_after": 0.3
		},
		{
		  "text": "Until he eventually found out the truth four days later in the evening…",
		  "pacing": 0.045,
		  "style": "narration",
		  "pause_after": 0
		}
	  ]
	},
	{
	  "name": "ChangeBackground",
	  "background": "dining_room"
	},
	{
	  "name": "FadeIn",
	  "duration": 1.5
	},
	{
	  "name": "LoadSprite",
	  "speaker": "Arthur",
	  "expression": "normal",
	  "position": "left"
	},
	{
	  "name": "LoadText",
	  "speaker": "Arthur",
	  "segments": [
		{
		  "text": "Madame, my apologies for interrupting your peaceful evening.",
		  "pacing": 0.06,
		  "style": "normal",
		  "pause_after": 0
		}
	  ]
	},
	{
	  "name": "LoadSprite",
	  "speaker": "Margaret",
	  "expression": "normal",
	  "position": "right",
	  "transition": "fade"
	},
	{
	  "name": "LoadText",
	  "speaker": "Margaret",
	  "segments": [
		{
		  "text": "Is there something you need, Arthur?",
		  "pacing": 0.05,
		  "style": "normal",
		  "pause_after": 0
		}
	  ]
	},
	{
	  "name": "LoadText",
	  "speaker": "Arthur",
	  "segments": [
		{
		  "text": "I received a report from a maid that there’s an unpleasant smell coming from the fuel storage room.",
		  "pacing": 0.06,
		  "style": "normal",
		  "pause_after": 0
		}
	  ]
	}
